    "UIName": "iATM Carrier",
    "Id": "vehicledef_CARRIER_iATM_NUKE",
    "Name": "iATM Carrier",
    "Details": "This version has nuclear-tipped ammunition. This variant of the LRM-AV Carrier replaces the LRM launchers with three Clan iATM-12s and upgrades the ECM to a Clan Nova CEWS, which allows accurate fire support when it is linked with other Nova CEWS units. It keeps the Clan Hardened armor, the Clan Laser AMS and the rear Clan Micro Pulse Laser. Its slow cruise speed and sensitive equipment pushed it into a base defense role, so most iATM Carriers defend Coreun bases, although it has also performed very well on important offensive missions.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Hardened (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       155     30\n<b>Left</b>         125     30\n<b>Right</b>       125     30\n<b>Rear</b>        105     30\n\n<b>Total</b>      510    120</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color>",
    "Icon": "LRMcarrier"
  },
